OL,3,W"###"###"###T//-,.,,-,.-/.-//,,.,.,.-//
OL,4,CLegal action taken against 'prolific   
OL,5,Cflag erector'                          
OL,6,GA city's "most prolific flag erector"  
OL,7,Ghas been hit with a legal warning      
OL,8,Gahead of potential court action.       
OL,10,FBristol City Council said it has       
OL,11,Fhanded the person they believe         
OL,12,Fresponsible for putting up the most    
OL,13,Fflags across the city a cease and      
OL,14,Fdesist letter - the first step in a    
OL,15,Flegal process.                         
OL,17,FAt a meeting on Friday, councillor     
OL,18,FStephen Williams said the council will 
OL,19,Fsee what effect that has on the city's 
OL,20,F"most prolific flag erector" before    
OL,21,Fdeciding next steps.                   
OL,22,                                   G1/4 
