OL,3,W"###"###"###T//-,.,,-,.-/.-//,,.,.,.-//
OL,4,CRain warning for Cornwall and Isles of 
OL,5,CScilly                                 
OL,6,GA yellow weather warning for rain is   
OL,7,Gcurrently in place across Cornwall and 
OL,8,Gthe Isles of Scilly.                   
OL,10,FThe Met Office said the warning would  
OL,11,Fbe in place from 08:01 GMT on Tuesday  
OL,12,Funtil 23:59 and warned heavy rain      
OL,13,Fcould cause some flooding and travel   
OL,14,Fdisruption.                            
OL,16,FIt said a band of heavy rain would     
OL,17,Fslowly move across the county          
OL,18,Fthroughout the day before it eases     
OL,19,Fovernight, with about 30-40mm of rain  
OL,20,Fexpected to fall.                      
OL,22,                                   G2/4 
