OL,3,W"###"###"###T//-,.,,-,.-/.-//,,.,.,.-//
OL,4,CStriking SEND staff 'devastated' by    
OL,5,Cshortages                              
OL,6,GSome teaching support staff at a       
OL,7,Gschool for pupils with severe or       
OL,8,Gprofound learning difficulties have    
OL,9,Ggone on strike in a row over staff     
OL,10,Gshortages.                             
OL,12,FUplands School in Swindon, Wiltshire,  
OL,13,Fnotified parents last Wednesday that   
OL,14,Fit would be closed on 24 and 25        
OL,15,FNovember.                              
OL,17,FTeaching assistant Victoria Brown said 
OL,18,Fnot being able to provide the "best    
OL,19,Fcare" to students was "absolutely      
OL,20,Fdevastating".                          
OL,22,                                   G3/4 
