OL,3,W"###"###"###T//-,.,,-,.-/.-//,,.,.,.-//
OL,4,CNephew wants change after killings of  
OL,5,Cuncles                                 
OL,6,GA nephew of twin brothers killed by a  
OL,7,Gman suffering a psychotic episode who  
OL,8,Gwas released from custody hours before 
OL,9,Gsays he has little confidence similar  
OL,10,Gcases could be prevented.              
OL,12,FThe deaths of Roger and Dick Carter,   
OL,13,Fboth 84, and Anthony Payne, 80, in     
OL,14,FExeter by Alexander Lewis-Ranwell on   
OL,15,F10 February 2019 followed a catalogue  
OL,16,Fof failings by police, healthcare      
OL,17,Fprofessionals and G4S-employed staff,  
OL,18,Fan inquest jury found.                 
OL,22,                                   G4/4 
